MIR is vendored from a pinned upstream master revision:

    https://github.com/vnmakarov/mir/tree/a8ab7c31cd5f9b23b77d84c60b3d83e62d9d304c

Upstream commit: a8ab7c31cd5f9b23b77d84c60b3d83e62d9d304c

Only the core MIR runtime and generator sources are included.  LambdaMOO uses
the generator at optimization level zero when configured with --enable-jit.
LambdaMOO carries small local additions to report generated-code length and
retained executable pages.  See LICENSE for MIR's MIT license.
